<title>NETHERLANDS: SHELL'S WAVIN UPS STAKE IN POLISH PLANT.</title>
<headline>SHELL'S WAVIN UPS STAKE IN POLISH PLANT.</headline>
<dateline>ZWOLLE, Netherlands 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastic pipes maker Wavin BV, a 50 percent-owned unit of Royal Dutch/Shell, said on Tuesday it had raised its stake in its Polish subsidiary Wavin Metalplast Buk to 77 percent from 41 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The remaining 23 percent of the shares of Wavin Metalplast Buk will be retained by the Polish state and the employees,&quot; Wavin said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Wavin Metalplast, which produces plastic pipes systems for the Polish market, was one of its most successful companies.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
